  message: "DONE (fix already landed via sibling validator) per bulk-verify 2026-07-17. The requested behavior -- validate the id kind-slot against the symbol-kind registry -- exists in _check_id_roundtrip (spec_validator.py:1800, if kind_slot not in registered: raise), wired into validate_ir (:244) as a first-class id_format-class check (:163), landed as ADR-0036 id-format:F3 (2026-06-13, AFTER this item's 2026-06-07 filing). The named _check_id_format keeps only the permissive char-class regex, but the registry check moved to the sibling function (NOT axis_conformance, which is blind to the id slot). The 1444-node premise NO LONGER REPRODUCES: current self-corpus (37,118 symbols) has 0 unregistered kind-slots + 0 kind-slot-vs-Symbol.kind disagreements (the ADR-0036 Ruling-2 external_symbol slot migration, ir.py:1264, cleared the WI-pubiv/WI-kugaj cohort). One deferred residual (separate decision): the check is advisory (warning), not error-level -- promotion is tracked by the ADR-0036 gating item, not this scope defect."  # 65bd
